From 59dfb905cd85371b08f078e69b230cb77d1dbfde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:11:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] docs/Project.toml: Terrarium compat 0.1.10, 0.2 (missed in
 #968)

The root Project.toml declares a workspace (docs, examples, test), so instantiating the test environment resolves
docs' compat too. #968 allowed Terrarium 0.2 in Project.toml, test/ and examples/ but not docs/, where Terrarium comes
from its main branch (now 0.2.0-DEV): every CI job that instantiates test fails with
"empty intersection between Terrarium@0.2.0+DEV and project compatibility 0.1.10 - 0.1".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvpxdTuD5JaD3hFhzdz
---
 docs/Project.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/docs/Project.toml b/docs/Project.toml
index 2032cf5a..af4a0abc 100755
--- a/docs/Project.toml
+++ b/docs/Project.toml
@@ -51,4 +51,4 @@ Literate = "2.2"
 Oceananigans = "0.117.2, 0.118"
 Reactant = "0.2.278"
 SpeedyWeather = "0.23, 0.24"
-Terrarium = "0.1.10"
+Terrarium = "0.1.10, 0.2"
-- 
2.43.0

